{"type":"standard","title":"JoAnna Mendoza","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">JoAnna Mendoza</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q141993947","titles":{"canonical":"JoAnna_Mendoza","normalized":"JoAnna Mendoza","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">JoAnna Mendoza</span></span>"},"pageid":83391464,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1383735733","tid":"795d2644-d85a-11f1-9e52-891b13c994d2","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:17:32Z","description":"American political candidate","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoAnna_Mendoza","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoAnna_Mendoza?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoAnna_Mendoza?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:JoAnna_Mendoza"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoAnna_Mendoza","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/JoAnna_Mendoza","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoAnna_Mendoza?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:JoAnna_Mendoza"}},"extract":"JoAnna H. Mendoza is an American politician and military veteran who is the U.S. representative-elect for Arizona's 6th congressional district. A member of the Democratic Party, Mendoza beat incumbent Republican Juan Ciscomani in the 2026 election.","extract_html":"<p><b>JoAnna H. Mendoza</b> is an American politician and military veteran who is the U.S. representative-elect for Arizona's 6th congressional district. A member of the Democratic Party, Mendoza beat incumbent Republican Juan Ciscomani in the 2026 election.</p>"}